INFO 03-28 14:03:16 [logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-72916c558a9248d79d8e03cc306d1b6e-0: prompt: "The following is the about us page on our website. We'd like you to suggest business name ideas based on the information contained on the about us page, particularly our values. Ideally it's a short memorable name. It doesn't have to be a real word. Here is the information: About Us\n\nFounded by the former president of an asset management and development firm, and recent CEO of an Austin based architecture firm, our company was born out of a need for better staffing solutions in the architecture industry. \n\nWith a deep understanding of the industry and the challenges that firms face, we set out to create a company that could help architecture firms build and retain successful businesses.\nMaking an Impact\n\nMany architects don't have the impact they hope for. \n\nModeling hours for communicating plans have increased, as have the complexity of software and technology. At the same time, the cost of living (salaries) for team members is rising rapidly, while clients are expecting the same cost of service. This has been made worse by the culture of long and late work days, which is no longer viable. \n\nArchitects understand the need for innovation but are often unwilling to apply it to their business. This is where Wecollabify comes in.\n\nWe want to fix this imbalance and create a support system for architects so they can make a strategic change in their business model. Wecollabify can help architects move away from just trying to survive and give them more time to focus on their best ideas, which will have a lasting impact on the world.\nOur Placement Philosophy\n\nAt Wecollabify, we understand that each member of your team and our talent pool are on a journey to develop their professional skills. We strive to help you select the right skill set for your needs and set clear expectations between both parties. We want to make sure the right people are solving the right problems at the right time for your firm.\n\nNo one employee is perfect in all areas, so we work hard to identify strengths and areas for improvement in each person. We believe that the foundation of a successful architecture firm is how they transmit knowledge and experience to their team members and that a firm’s longevity and stability depend on the expertise and experience it has.\n\nIn architecture, turnover is one of the biggest uncontrolled costs, so we want to make sure placements are a great fit for the long-term. This is in the best interest of the client, the talent, and WeCollabify. When everyone works together, the talent can become more skilled and be relied upon with greater autonomy as a key member of the team. \nTo ensure success, we classify the abilities of our talent pool and match them to our clients’ needs. We also provide nurturing programs to help our placed staff members advance their careers.\n\nMentorship Network: We have a mentorship network that encourages collaboration and peer teaching. Our philosophy is that remote collaboration and peer empowerment can help speed up the learning process in architecture. Through our network, design mentors and mentees can both teach and learn from each other.\n\n“How-to” Assistance Network: We have a hive-mind philosophy, so our designers get help from their remote peers for the tasks they need to do each day. This could involve knowing how to use a software, having technical or coding knowledge, having a specific skill, or having experience in a particular area.\nOur Mission\nAt WeCollabify, we are dedicated to helping architecture firms unlock their potential and succeed in a constantly evolving industry. \n\nOur mission is to provide high-quality staffing and consulting services that are tailored to our clients’ specific needs and goals. We are committed to building long-term relationships with our clients and to helping them unlock their full effectiveness. \n\nTo this end, we embrace technology, remote, and virtual work to break through any limitations and unlock previously unavailable strategies and synergies. Our goal is to provide customized solutions that assist our clients in achieving success.\nOur Vision\nOur vision is to become the go-to partner for architecture firms looking to streamline their operations, increase their profitability, and maximize their potential. We aim to be the industry leader in staffing and consulting services and to leverage the latest technology and best practices to deliver unparalleled value to our clients.\nWhat is WeSelf?\nAt Wecollabify, we value community, fraternity, and consortium, and we strive to foster a shared consciousness within our team through a hive mind mentality. Decentralized decision-making empowers us to execute with autonomy and WeSelf is our shared sense of purpose. \n\nWe believe that by nurturing potential and providing support through success managers, a mentor network, and collaboration, we can help everyone on our team be successful. Our identity is rooted in the love we have for what we do and our commitment to empowering each other.\nOur Values\nWe believe in the idea that our knowledge and accomplishments are not necessarily limited to our individual capabilities, but rather the collective wisdom of our team. By working together, we are able to access a larger network of information and ideas, enabling us to create the best possible outcome.\nWe have an uplifting influence on those we interact with and our identity is based on the fact that we work because we love what we do. \nWe create an environment that fosters growth of both individuals and our clients. \nWe think for ourselves and make decentralized decisions for the betterment of the whole. \nWe enable others to use their problem-solving skills and strive for excellence in everything we do. \nWe believe in the power of teamwork and collaborate closely with our clients and partners to achieve their goals.\nWe approach every project with empathy and a deep commitment to its success while always looking for new and better ways of doing things. \nBy embracing change, progress, and the collective mind, we can make a positive impact on the world around us.\nWho we serve\nOur services are designed for architecture firms of all sizes and types, from small boutique firms to large multidisciplinary organizations. We serve clients across the United States, and we specialize in remote staffing and consulting services that help our clients overcome the challenges of a fast-paced and dynamic industry.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.1, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=2000, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [785, 2701, 374, 279, 911, 601, 2150, 389, 1039, 3910, 13, 1205, 4172, 1075, 498, 311, 4190, 2562, 829, 6708, 3118, 389, 279, 1995, 12985, 389, 279, 911, 601, 2150, 11, 7945, 1039, 2750, 13, 66701, 432, 594, 264, 2805, 32496, 829, 13, 1084, 3171, 944, 614, 311, 387, 264, 1931, 3409, 13, 5692, 374, 279, 1995, 25, 9975, 3985, 271, 84873, 553, 279, 4741, 4767, 315, 458, 9329, 6240, 323, 4401, 7474, 11, 323, 3213, 12156, 315, 458, 19260, 3118, 17646, 7474, 11, 1039, 2813, 572, 9223, 700, 315, 264, 1184, 369, 2664, 64051, 9904, 304, 279, 17646, 4958, 13, 4710, 2354, 264, 5538, 8660, 315, 279, 4958, 323, 279, 11513, 429, 18809, 3579, 11, 582, 738, 700, 311, 1855, 264, 2813, 429, 1410, 1492, 17646, 18809, 1936, 323, 14060, 6849, 9675, 624, 42246, 458, 28580, 271, 8441, 54935, 1513, 944, 614, 279, 5421, 807, 3900, 369, 13, 4710, 1712, 287, 4115, 369, 41147, 6649, 614, 7172, 11, 438, 614, 279, 23094, 315, 3162, 323, 5440, 13, 2411, 279, 1852, 882, 11, 279, 