e banking to do my own wire transfer so i don\'t to call a bank every time like most people do because again i\'m location independent so this is your delivery system location independent that\'s the name of the game and if it\'s not location dependent if the client says i have to give you a check there are still people out there like this matter of fact my wife was just working with a person a little while ago and he was like no i only pay via check if they insist on paying checks you don\'t do business if it\'s an old school industry that insists on physically handing you a piece of paper for something you don\'t do business or you don\'t do that kind of business everything must be location dependent both the delivery system to the client and the payment system from the client or customer cool now again what most people do when they start a business is this is the first step they go okay i gotta set up a website and i gotta set up a way to you know email the stuff and i gotta set up a check account a paypal account and i gotta set up a merchant account and they do this before they\'ve identified a niche before they\'ve identified a problem before in many cases they even priced out their product or made an offer no this is the final step before you start hardcore marketing which we talked about in the last lesson this is it this is not the first step it\'s the last step and i have to reiterate that because if you are a more intelligent person higher iq person college educated person what you\'re going to want to do is focus a lot of time on this no this is the last step before you market the more important steps the ones we already covered in the prior videos especially establishing a niche and structuring your business first then you do this now if you want help with setting up your own location independent business where we actually hold your hand and walk you through the process the 90 day business builder you have access to that now for probably the lowest price it will ever be we will actually over 12 week period we will work with you every week and show you exactly the exact steps on what to do you\'ll check off when you do them you\'ll work with an accountability coach if you have trouble doing that 12 week process plus you have a lot of online courses many of the online courses that i have in terms of business and location dependent companies you will get for free as part of this program you get the let\'s see you get the alpha 2. 0 business course you get the how to get clients course you get big income from little work which is a book i read on how to create location dependent income you get the entire program for 12 weeks you get a lot of stuff for very little money because you will be making money at the end of 12 weeks and if you aren\'t making any money our guarantees will keep working with you forever until you do because i\'m confident you will if you have any interest in doing this especially if you tried a business before in the past and failed or you\'re nervous about setting up your first business because you haven\'t done it before or you have been a little lazy in setting up your own business you know it\'s something you\'ve wanted to do for a long time but you just didn\'t have the right direction and you need a little more direction a little more accountability if that\'s you click the link below to schedule your phone call it\'ll be with me or with one of my coaches depends who you get where there\'s only a limited time in which you could schedule these calls then we close the window because we only can take on a certain number of people into the program at once so there is a limited number of people who will accept in this and current enrollment for the next 12 weeks click the link below or wherever it is depending on your watching this video to schedule that call it is free you can get all your questions answered we\'ll go through all the details of how it works if it\'s not for you that is perfectl